   * Security considerations include automatic filtering of results to the
   * current user only, with no opportunity to view other users' profiles. This
   * implementation directly addresses the business requirements for private
   * user data management.
   *
   * @param connection
   * @param body Search criteria and pagination parameters for user profile
   *   filtering
   * @x-autobe-specification Implement cursor-based pagination for user profile search. Query 'todo_users' table with request filters (e.g., display name), but enforce privacy filter to return only the current user's profile. Return 20 items per page with 'next' cursor for subsequent requests. Cache results for 15 minutes with user-specific cache keys. Avoid returning email or other sensitive data in summary view.
