    }
  }

  /**
   * Retrieve the profile information for the current user.
   *
   * This operation returns basic profile information for the currently
   * authenticated user, specifically their display name. The system maintains
   * strict user data privacy with no data shared between accounts. Each user
   * can only view their own profile.
   *
   * The profile information includes the user's display name, which can be
   * optionally set during registration. The authentication system ensures that
   * the requested user ID matches the authenticated user's ID before returning
   * data. This prevents users from viewing other user profiles.
   *
   * This operation implements a secure user profile retrieval mechanism that
   * respects the private nature of the todo application. Profile fields are
   * intentionally limited to just the display name to maintain privacy and
   * focus functionality on the core task management features. The response does
   * not include email or other sensitive information.
   *
   * @param connection
