   *   to user's own account)
   * @x-autobe-specification Retrieve the user profile for the authenticated user.
   *
   * Implementation notes:
   * - Only return the user's own profile, no other user data
   * - Ensure security: authenticate via JWT and verify user ID matches authenticated user
   * - Response contains only the display name field from the database schema
   * - Database table: todo_users
   * - Profile contains: id (from path), display_name
   * - This implementation ensures strict privacy boundaries between user accounts as required
   * - The userId parameter is used for lookup but must match the authenticated user
   * @nestia Generated by Nestia - https://github.com/samchon/nestia
