   * for invalid inputs. All profile updates are processed within the user's
   * private account scope, maintaining the application's fundamental privacy
   * principles.
   *
   * Implementation note: This endpoint verifies user identity against the path
   * parameter using the authenticated session, then updates only the
   * displayName field in the database. The profile update does not affect todo
   * items or history, which are maintained separately under the todo system.
   * The service validates all inputs before database write to prevent data
   * corruption.
   *
   * @param connection
   * @param userId Unique identifier of the target user account (UUID)
   * @param body New display name for the user profile
   * @x-autobe-specification 1. Verify session user ID matches path userId parameter via JWT token
   * 2. Validate displayName length (1-50 characters) and format (only letters, numbers, and basic punctuation)
