   * @param connection
   * @param body New todo item creation details
   * @x-autobe-specification Create a new todo item for the authenticated user. Validate title is provided and non-empty. Automatically mark created todo as incomplete with status field set to false. Store all optional fields (description, start_date, due_date) as provided. Do not store any fields that are not in the request body. Return the newly created todo with all fields populated (including creation timestamps). Verify user is authenticated and has access to create items in their own todo list.
