   * @x-autobe-specification Query the todo_todos table with the provided todoId parameter. Fetch all fields including title, description, startDate, dueDate, isComplete, createdAt, and updatedAt. Apply user access controls to ensure only the owner's todo items are retrieved. No request body needed for GET operation.
