   * @param connection
   * @param todoId Unique identifier of the target todo item (UUID)
   * @x-autobe-specification Implement soft delete by setting the 'deleted' flag to true for the specified todo in the todo_todos table. Verify the todo belongs to the authenticated user before deletion. Update timestamp fields to current time. Return HTTP 204 No Content on success. Ensure no history entries remain with the todo (history entries are automatically invalidated in business rules)
   * @nestia Generated by Nestia - https://github.com/samchon/nestia
   */
  @TypedRoute.Delete(":todoId")
